@HyperCache_HostAddress = https://localhost:7148

### Paged list. Note the ETag header on the response.
GET {{HyperCache_HostAddress}}/api/customproperties/paged?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Same request with the ETag from above: Delta answers 304 Not Modified without hitting the table.
GET {{HyperCache_HostAddress}}/api/customproperties/paged?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
If-None-Match: "<paste-etag-here>"

### Search by name
GET {{HyperCache_HostAddress}}/api/customproperties/search?keyword=Orders_Property_1
Accept: application/json

### Single item (use an Id from the paged response)
GET {{HyperCache_HostAddress}}/api/customproperties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Everything (large payload; the request the README benchmarks)
GET {{HyperCache_HostAddress}}/api/customproperties/all
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only). Browsable UI at {{HyperCache_HostAddress}}/scalar
GET {{HyperCache_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
